+/**
+ * ixgbe_send_vf_link_status - send link status data to VF
+ * @adapter: pointer to adapter struct
+ * @msgbuf: pointer to message buffers
+ * @vf: VF identifier
+ *
+ * Reply for IXGBE_VF_GET_PF_LINK_STATE mbox command sending link status data.
